 "blocksHtml": "<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Contra_Promo_DRIBBLE_compressed24.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2891\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid grid--no-gutter flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-11/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nA calculated experience\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nContra’s project calculator is a gamified experience that helps users determine whether hiring a freelancer or full time roles is appropriate for their needs. The calculator analyses the requirements and benchmarks cost against time spent to compare total spend and time to impact for each option. The experience aims to create an engaging, memorable and shareable experience to promote Contra’s offering. \n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglParallaxEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image28956aaa773743a6c\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/contra_web_grid.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/full_runthrough_compressed26.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2897\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid grid--no-gutter flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-11/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nA calculated experience\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nContra’s project calculator is a gamified experience that helps users determine whether hiring a freelancer or full time roles is appropriate for their needs. The calculator analyses the requirements and benchmarks cost against time spent to compare total spend and time to impact for each option. The experience aims to create an engaging, memorable and shareable experience to promote Contra’s offering. \n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image28986aaa77374bee5\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Frame-10122378.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image28996aaa77375326c\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Frame-10122379.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image29006aaa77375afc3\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Frame-10122380.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container d-flex@sm items-center justify-center mb-5 mb-20@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/3@sm mb-6 mb-0@sm relative\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--1/1 aspect--3/2@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '0%' : 0 }, rotationY: 30, rotationZ: 3, scrollTrigger: { scrub: 0.5, once: false }\" animate-to=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '30%' : 0 }, rotationY: 10, rotationZ: -3\" class=\"aspect__child\" data-tex-type=\"image\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<img alt=\"\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Frame-317-1.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/3@sm relative\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--1/1 aspect--3/2@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '0%' : 0 }, rotationY: -30, rotationZ: -3, scrollTrigger: { scrub: 0.5, once: false }\" animate-to=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '-10%' : 0 }, rotationY: -10, rotationZ: 3\" class=\"aspect__child\" data-tex-type=\"image\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<img alt=\"\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Frame-317-1-1.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"testimonial w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"container my-5 my-10@md\">\n<h2 class=\"t-1.3 t-2@sm t-uppercase mb-0 t-500\">In their words</h2>\n<div class=\"testimonial__text-box mt-1 pt-1 mb-1.5\">\n<p class=\"w-1/1 t-2 t-3@sm t-lh-1 t-500 mb-0\">\n“The Contra team has worked with Nocturne multiple times in the past few years to ideate, build, and launch some of our most creative marketing sites. The Nocturne team is wildly talented and inspiring to work with. If you want a gorgeous, award-winning site — they’re it.”\n</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"t-uppercase t-base t-1.3@sm t-500\">\nErin Horner, Head of Creative\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image29046aaa77377461e\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Frame-10122381.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image29056aaa77377afa7\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Report.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image29066aaa773780b94\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Spreadsheet-Inputs.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglParallaxEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image29016aaa773786d2f\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/contra_storyboard.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid grid--no-gutter flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-11/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nDesigning the device\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nWith both aesthetics and utility of the device to consider the design of the Contra Calculator device was a nuanced process. The art direction was inspired by retro tech, we wanted the device to have a tactile and nostalgic feel to it. Buttons that depress and switches and levers that click and clack – a break from the soulless touch screens we use today. This in itself created a number of challenges, the biggest of which being the device needing to fit and function across all screen sizes whilst still maintaining an aesthetically pleasing form overall. We went through a huge amount of iterations and prototypes until we were happy with the final form, made from a number of interlocking parts which helped create that interesting flow through the site. \n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image29456aaa773787819\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/concept_grid-1920x1406.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"js-grid-slider mb-5 mb-10@sm overflow-hidden user-select-none\" data-cursor=\"drag\" data-cursor-progress=\"0\" style=\"touch-action: pan-y\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"d-flex items-center\" style=\"user-select: none;\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2 w-1/4@sm mr-5 mr-8@sm flex-no-shrink pointer-events-none\">\n<div class=\"mb-2\" style=\"perspective: 1000px;\">\n<div class=\"js-grid-slider-text\">\n<h2 animate-from=\"preset: 'fadeUp'\" class=\"mb-1 t-500 t-lh-1.1 t-uppercase t-ls-tight t-base\">Early concepts</h2>\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">A look at some of our early device design and material explorations.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none js-slider-items\">\n<div class=\"d-flex mb-4\"><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(15%, 15%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"100\" dom2webgl=\"image29387313\" draggable=